        "content": [
          "PASSÉ COMPOSÉ — a past tense with",
          "TWO parts: avoir (present) + past",
          "participle. For now, just recognize",
          "it:",
          "",
          "-ER verbs → participle ends -é:      Press 1",
          "fermer → fermé",
          "j'ai fermé = I closed",
          "",
          "il a parlé  = he spoke              Press 2",
          "nous avons mangé = we ate",
          "",
          "Pattern: avoir + [verb]-é. You'll",
          "meet -ir/-re participles, and the",
          "avoir/être split, in Tier 3."
        ],
        "pronunciation": "Leçon dix",
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "j'ai fermé",
          "2": "il a parlé, nous avons mangé"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
